From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wq9001: port the driver to Linux 7.3

Guard the private ifreq definitions, use the 7.3 cfg80211
signatures and wrappers, fix timers, netif_rx, access_ok,
pid, strncpy/strlcpy and the inline crypto helper.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
diff --git a/Makefile b/Makefile
index 8baf0e8..eb47d1d 100755
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -65,6 +65,10 @@ subdir-ccflags-y +=  -I$(DRV_PATH)/wdrv -I$(DRV_PATH)/wdrv/mwl  -I$(DRV_PATH)/os
 
 ccflags-y += -DWQ_DEBUG
 ccflags-y += -Wno-error=missing-prototypes
+ccflags-y += -Wno-error=implicit-fallthrough
+ccflags-y += -Wno-error=array-parameter
+ccflags-y += -Wno-error=misleading-indentation
+ccflags-y += -Wno-error=discarded-qualifiers
 #ccflags-y += -DWQ_SIM_HOST_ONLY
 #ccflags-y += -DWQ_BUS_TEST
 ccflags-y += -DWQ_FW_DL
